          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個旅行寄存項目不是密文殼恢復格式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "当前未配置可用PIN，请先输入PIN或在设置中开启“记住PIN”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No available PIN is configured. Please enter a PIN first or enable \"Remember PIN\" in Settings."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
