          }
        }
      }
    },
    "若使用 Face ID 解锁，加密密钥存储在安全隔区芯片中，即使越狱也难以提取": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you use Face ID unlock, encryption keys are stored in the Secure Enclave and are still difficult to extract even on a jailbroken device"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si usa desbloqueo con Face ID, las claves de cifrado se almacenan en Secure Enclave y siguen siendo difíciles de extraer incluso en un dispositivo con jailbreak"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Face IDで解錠する場合、暗号鍵はSecure Enclaveに保存され、脱獄端末でも抽出は困難です"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若使用 Face ID 解鎖，加密金鑰儲存在安全隔區晶片中，即使越獄也難以提取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
