    "记住PIN": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remember PIN"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordar PIN"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PINを記憶"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "記住 PIN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "记住PIN后，添加和使用通用硬件密钥通道时可免去重复输入，PIN仅存储在本机Keychain中。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After enabling Remember PIN, repeated input is skipped when adding or using the generic hardware key channel. PIN is stored only in local Keychain."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Al activar Recordar PIN, se evita la entrada repetida al añadir o usar el canal genérico de llave de hardware. El PIN solo se guarda en el Keychain local."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PINを記憶すると、汎用ハードウェアキーチャネルの追加・利用時に再入力を省略できます。PINはローカルKeychainのみに保存されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "記住 PIN 後，新增和使用通用硬體密鑰通道時可免去重複輸入，PIN 僅儲存在本機 Keychain 中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
